{"1-10":{"people":[{"id":"peter-g4074g","name":"Peter","kind":"person","brief":"An apostle","count":4,"firstVerse":1},{"id":"john-g2491h","name":"John","kind":"person","brief":"An apostle","count":3,"firstVerse":1},{"id":"jesus-g2424g","name":"Jesus","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Joseph","count":1,"firstVerse":6}],"places":[{"id":"beautiful-gate-g5611","name":"Beautiful Gate","kind":"place","brief":"","count":2,"firstVerse":2},{"id":"nazareth-g3478","name":"Nazareth","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":6}],"words":[{"base":"G2411","lemma":"ἱερόν","tr":"hieros","gloss":"temple","lang":"g","inPassage":6,"uses":70},{"base":"G4043","lemma":"περιπατέω","tr":"peripateō","gloss":"to walk","lang":"g","inPassage":4,"uses":94},{"base":"G1654","lemma":"ἐλεημοσύνη","tr":"eleēmosunē","gloss":"charity","lang":"g","inPassage":3,"uses":13},{"base":"G4074","lemma":"Πέτρος","tr":"Petros","gloss":"Peter","lang":"g","inPassage":4,"uses":155},{"base":"G5611","lemma":"ὡραῖος","tr":"hōraios","gloss":"Beautiful","lang":"g","inPassage":2,"uses":4},{"base":"G2491","lemma":"Ἰωάννης","tr":"Iōannēs","gloss":"John","lang":"g","inPassage":3,"uses":135},{"base":"G0134","lemma":"αἰνέω","tr":"aineō","gloss":"to praise","lang":"g","inPassage":2,"uses":8},{"base":"G5225","lemma":"ὑπάρχω","tr":"huparchō","gloss":"be already","lang":"g","inPassage":2,"uses":60},{"base":"G1909","lemma":"ἐπί","tr":"epi","gloss":"upon","lang":"g","inPassage":3,"uses":885},{"base":"G4862","lemma":"σύν","tr":"sun","gloss":"with","lang":"g","inPassage":2,"uses":128}],"parallels":[],"crossrefs":[{"book":"ACT","chapter":3,"verse":16,"verseEnd":16,"votes":24,"source":"both","text":"By faith in the name of Jesus, this man whom you see and know has been made strong. It is Jesusʼ name and the faith that comes through Him that has given him this complete healing in your presence.","from":6},{"book":"PSA","chapter":55,"verse":17,"verseEnd":17,"votes":19,"source":"both","text":"Morning, noon, and night, I cry out in distress, and He hears my voice.","from":1},{"book":"ACT","chapter":4,"verse":10,"verseEnd":10,"votes":16,"source":"both","text":"then let this be known to all of you and to all the people of Israel: It is by the name of Jesus Christ of Nazareth, whom you crucified but whom God raised from the dead, that this man stands before you healed.","from":6},{"book":"ACT","chapter":10,"verse":38,"verseEnd":38,"votes":16,"source":"both","text":"how God anointed Jesus of Nazareth with the Holy Spirit and with power, and how Jesus went around doing good and healing all who were oppressed by the devil, because God was with Him.","from":6},{"book":"ACT","chapter":9,"verse":34,"verseEnd":34,"votes":13,"source":"both","text":"“Aeneas,” Peter said to him, “Jesus Christ heals you! Get up and put away your mat.” Immediately Aeneas got up,","from":6},{"book":"ACT","chapter":10,"verse":3,"verseEnd":3,"votes":12,"source":"both","text":"One day at about the ninth hour, he had a clear vision of an angel of God who came to him and said, “Cornelius!”","from":1},{"book":"2CO","chapter":8,"verse":9,"verseEnd":9,"votes":12,"source":"both","text":"For you know the grace of our Lord Jesus Christ, that though He was rich, yet for your sakes He became poor, so that you through His poverty might become rich.","from":6},{"book":"MRK","chapter":16,"verse":17,"verseEnd":17,"votes":11,"source":"both","text":"And these signs will accompany those who believe: In My name they will drive out demons; they will speak in new tongues;","from":6}],"notes":[],"groups":[{"id":"john-baptist-circle","title":"John the Baptist's Circle","people":3},{"id":"jerusalem-church","title":"The Jerusalem Church","people":3},{"id":"high-priestly-family","title":"The High-Priestly Family","people":3},{"id":"paul-circle","title":"Paul's Circle","people":2},{"id":"herod-family","title":"The Herods","people":2},{"id":"bethany-and-friends","title":"Bethany and the Women Around Jesus","people":2},{"id":"roman-officials","title":"Roman Officials","people":2},{"id":"the-twelve","title":"The Twelve Apostles","people":2}]},"11-16":{"people":[{"id":"peter-g4074g","name":"Peter","kind":"person","brief":"An apostle","count":2,"firstVerse":11},{"id":"john-g2491h","name":"John","kind":"person","brief":"An apostle","count":1,"firstVerse":11},{"id":"israel-h3478","name":"Israel","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Isaac","count":2,"firstVerse":12},{"id":"abraham-h0085","name":"Abraham","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Terah","count":1,"firstVerse":13},{"id":"isaac-h3327","name":"Isaac","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Abraham","count":1,"firstVerse":13},{"id":"jesus-g2424g","name":"Jesus","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Joseph","count":1,"firstVerse":13},{"id":"pilate-g4091","name":"Pilate","kind":"person","brief":"A Roman ruler","count":1,"firstVerse":13}],"places":[{"id":"solomon-s-portico-g4672h","name":"Solomon's Portico","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":11}],"words":[{"base":"G0720","lemma":"ἀρνέομαι","tr":"arneomai","gloss":"to deny","lang":"g","inPassage":2,"uses":33},{"base":"G1909","lemma":"ἐπί","tr":"epi","gloss":"upon","lang":"g","inPassage":3,"uses":885},{"base":"G2992","lemma":"λαός","tr":"laos","gloss":"a people","lang":"g","inPassage":2,"uses":141},{"base":"G4074","lemma":"Πέτρος","tr":"Petros","gloss":"Peter","lang":"g","inPassage":2,"uses":155},{"base":"G0435","lemma":"ἀνήρ","tr":"anēr","gloss":"man","lang":"g","inPassage":2,"uses":216},{"base":"G3686","lemma":"ὄνομα","tr":"onoma","gloss":"name","lang":"g","inPassage":2,"uses":229},{"base":"G4102","lemma":"πίστις","tr":"pistis","gloss":"faith","lang":"g","inPassage":2,"uses":243},{"base":"G2228","lemma":"ἤ","tr":"ē","gloss":"or","lang":"g","inPassage":2,"uses":343},{"base":"G4732","lemma":"στερεόω","tr":"stereoō","gloss":"to strengthen","lang":"g","inPassage":1,"uses":3},{"base":"G4936","lemma":"συντρέχω","tr":"suntrechō","gloss":"to flock","lang":"g","inPassage":1,"uses":3}],"parallels":[],"crossrefs":[{"book":"MAT","chapter":21,"verse":21,"verseEnd":21,"votes":12,"source":"openbible","text":"“Truly I tell you,” Jesus replied, “if you have faith and do not doubt, not only will you do what was done to the fig tree, but even if you say to this mountain, ‘Be lifted up and thrown into the sea,’ it will happen.","from":16},{"book":"MAT","chapter":21,"verse":22,"verseEnd":22,"votes":12,"source":"openbible","text":"If you believe, you will receive whatever you ask for in prayer.”","from":16},{"book":"2CO","chapter":3,"verse":5,"verseEnd":5,"votes":11,"source":"both","text":"Not that we are competent in ourselves to claim that anything comes from us, but our competence comes from God.","from":12},{"book":"ACT","chapter":3,"verse":6,"verseEnd":6,"votes":10,"source":"both","text":"But Peter said, “Silver or gold I do not have, but what I have I give you: In the name of Jesus Christ of Nazareth, get up and walk!”","from":16},{"book":"ACT","chapter":4,"verse":10,"verseEnd":10,"votes":10,"source":"both","text":"then let this be known to all of you and to all the people of Israel: It is by the name of Jesus Christ of Nazareth, whom you crucified but whom God raised from the dead, that this man stands before you healed.","from":16},{"book":"ACT","chapter":14,"verse":9,"verseEnd":9,"votes":10,"source":"both","text":"This man was listening to the words of Paul, who looked intently at him and saw that he had faith to be healed.","from":16},{"book":"MRK","chapter":1,"verse":24,"verseEnd":24,"votes":9,"source":"both","text":"“What do You want with us, Jesus of Nazareth? Have You come to destroy us? I know who You are—the Holy One of God!”","from":14},{"book":"MRK","chapter":16,"verse":17,"verseEnd":17,"votes":9,"source":"openbible","text":"And these signs will accompany those who believe: In My name they will drive out demons; they will speak in new tongues;","from":16}],"notes":[],"groups":[{"id":"high-priestly-family","title":"The High-Priestly Family","people":4},{"id":"herod-family","title":"The Herods","people":3},{"id":"john-baptist-circle","title":"John the Baptist's Circle","people":3},{"id":"bethany-and-friends","title":"Bethany and the Women Around Jesus","people":3},{"id":"jerusalem-church","title":"The Jerusalem Church","people":3},{"id":"roman-officials","title":"Roman Officials","people":3},{"id":"patriarchs","title":"The patriarchal families","people":3},{"id":"paul-circle","title":"Paul's Circle","people":2},{"id":"the-twelve","title":"The Twelve Apostles","people":2}]},"17-26":{"people":[{"id":"jesus-g2424g","name":"Jesus","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Joseph","count":2,"firstVerse":18},{"id":"moses-h4872","name":"Moses","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Amram","count":1,"firstVerse":22},{"id":"samuel-h8050g","name":"Samuel","kind":"person","brief":"Prophet and Judge","count":1,"firstVerse":24},{"id":"abraham-h0085","name":"Abraham","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Terah","count":1,"firstVerse":25}],"places":[],"words":[{"base":"G4396","lemma":"προφήτης","tr":"prophētēs","gloss":"prophet","lang":"g","inPassage":6,"uses":144},{"base":"G0575","lemma":"ἀπό","tr":"apo","gloss":"away from","lang":"g","inPassage":4,"uses":644},{"base":"G2980","lemma":"λαλέω","tr":"laleō","gloss":"to speak","lang":"g","inPassage":3,"uses":294},{"base":"G4314","lemma":"πρός","tr":"pros","gloss":"to","lang":"g","inPassage":3,"uses":700},{"base":"G4750","lemma":"στόμα","tr":"stoma","gloss":"mouth","lang":"g","inPassage":2,"uses":78},{"base":"G0450","lemma":"ἀνίστημι","tr":"anistēmi","gloss":"to arise","lang":"g","inPassage":2,"uses":107},{"base":"G3745","lemma":"ὅσος","tr":"hosos","gloss":"just as","lang":"g","inPassage":2,"uses":110},{"base":"G0649","lemma":"ἀποστέλλω","tr":"apostellō","gloss":"to send","lang":"g","inPassage":2,"uses":132},{"base":"G0302","lemma":"ἄν","tr":"an","gloss":"if","lang":"g","inPassage":2,"uses":166},{"base":"G3303","lemma":"μέν","tr":"men","gloss":"on the other hand","lang":"g","inPassage":2,"uses":178}],"parallels":[],"crossrefs":[{"book":"DEU","chapter":18,"verse":15,"verseEnd":15,"votes":61,"source":"openbible","text":"The LORD your God will raise up for you a prophet like me from among your brothers. You must listen to him.","from":22},{"book":"DEU","chapter":18,"verse":19,"verseEnd":19,"votes":61,"source":"openbible","text":"And I will hold accountable anyone who does not listen to My words that the prophet speaks in My name.","from":22},{"book":"ACT","chapter":2,"verse":38,"verseEnd":38,"votes":31,"source":"both","text":"Peter replied, “Repent and be baptized, every one of you, in the name of Jesus Christ for the forgiveness of your sins, and you will receive the gift of the Holy Spirit.","from":19},{"book":"ISA","chapter":44,"verse":22,"verseEnd":22,"votes":26,"source":"openbible","text":"I have blotted out your transgressions like a cloud, and your sins like a mist. Return to Me, for I have redeemed you.","from":19},{"book":"ISA","chapter":43,"verse":25,"verseEnd":25,"votes":24,"source":"openbible","text":"I, yes I, am He who blots out your transgressions for My own sake and remembers your sins no more.","from":19},{"book":"MAT","chapter":13,"verse":15,"verseEnd":15,"votes":20,"source":"both","text":"For this peopleʼs heart has grown callous; they hardly hear with their ears, and they have closed their eyes. Otherwise they might see with their eyes, hear with their ears, understand with their hearts, and turn, and I would heal them.’","from":19},{"book":"MAT","chapter":18,"verse":3,"verseEnd":3,"votes":19,"source":"both","text":"“Truly I tell you,” He said, “unless you change and become like little children, you will never enter the kingdom of heaven.","from":19},{"book":"ISA","chapter":1,"verse":16,"verseEnd":16,"votes":18,"source":"openbible","text":"Wash and cleanse yourselves. Remove your evil deeds from My sight. Stop doing evil!","from":19}],"notes":[{"id":"gen-12-3","title":"All nations blessed through Abraham","kind":"prophecy"},{"id":"deut-18-15","title":"A prophet like Moses","kind":"prophecy"}],"groups":[]}}